 "remarks": "Fabulous in-town location on a charming cul-de-sac, with sidewalks to downtown New Canaan, Mead Park, South School, Saxe and NCHS! This beautifully appointed home impresses with its scale, high ceilings and exceptional millwork, offering over 6,000 square feet across four finished levels, with 5 generous bedrooms and 4.5 baths. The gorgeous kitchen opens to the family room, and the elegant dining room flows into the sunroom and out to the updated deck overlooking the fully fenced backyard, just steps from the Bristow Bird Sanctuary. The finished walkout lower level features 9-foot ceilings, an open layout, a full bath and a movie room. The light-filled third floor offers flexible space for a gym, playroom and office. Public water and sewer. A rare combination of scale, craftsmanship and convenience in the heart of New Canaan!",
